sequenceDiagram
    participant Worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Queue
    Worker->>DB: release_expired_seats()
    DB->>DB: Lock expired pending rows
    DB->>DB: Decrement lane and mark expired
    DB->>Queue: Attempt promote_from_queue()
    DB-->>Worker: Released count
    Worker->>DB: finishPromotions()
    DB->>DB: Issue passport and queue notification job
    Worker->>DB: Self-heal sweep sees job
